{
  "description": "To install exterior Christmas decorations to the facade of Guess Regent St on the evening of November 4th - proposed derig is 7th January 2027. Installation of External Façade Decorations to be installed in Guess Regent Street Store:\n-Truck unloading from the main entrance/loading bay\n-Delivery of the material to the site\n-Positioning and assembly of the lifting equipment.\n-Installation of metal bars and steel support structures for anchoring and mechanical fixing to the existing store façade, without drilling any holes.\n-Installation and securing of garlands, outdoor LED lights and decorative elements to the metal support structure and steel cables using cable ties and clamps.\n-All installation and handling activities will be carried out using a mobile scaffold tower, ladders and/or lifting equipment.\n-General cleaning\n-Contrator name: Visualplex",
